    "id": "cynbit_company_001",
    "source": "cynbit.in/about",
    "title": "About Cynbit Technologies",
    "content": "Cynbit Technologies is a technology startup founded in April 2024, headquartered in Jaipur, Rajasthan, India. The company operates under the philosophy of 'Engineering for Optimism' — a belief that thoughtfully built technology can solve real human problems and create positive societal impact. With a team of approximately 15 engineers, designers, and growth strategists, Cynbit focuses on building AI-powered products and services for startups and mid-market businesses across India and globally.",
    "category": "company",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_company_002",
    "source": "cynbit.in/about",
    "title": "Cynbit Mission and Philosophy",
    "content": "Cynbit's core philosophy is 'Engineering for Optimism'. This means the team builds technology not just for efficiency, but for meaningful human outcomes. The company believes that AI and automation, when designed responsibly, can democratize access to opportunity — whether that is helping small businesses compete with larger players through intelligent automation, or giving underprivileged students access to adaptive learning tools. Every product and service at Cynbit is evaluated through this lens: does it create genuine value?",
    "category": "company",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_company_003",
    "source": "cynbit.in/about",
    "title": "Cynbit Founding Story",
    "content": "Cynbit Technologies was co-founded in April 2024 by Mohak Saini (CEO) and Ashutosh Upadhyay (Co-founder), with Dhawan Kumar Nama serving as Chief Technology Officer. The founders identified a gap in the Indian startup ecosystem: most AI integration and automation tools were either too expensive for small businesses or required deep technical expertise to implement. Cynbit was built to bridge that gap — offering enterprise-grade AI capabilities with startup-friendly pricing and hands-on implementation support.",
    "category": "company",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
