    "content": "Dhawan Kumar Nama serves as the Chief Technology Officer of Cynbit Technologies. He leads the engineering team and oversees the technical architecture of Cynbit's products and client deliverables. Dhawan specializes in AI/ML systems, scalable backend infrastructure, and LLM integration. His technical leadership ensures that Cynbit's solutions are not just innovative but also production-ready and maintainable.",
