  {
    "id": "cynbit_services_001",
    "source": "cynbit.in/services",
    "title": "AI Agents & Automation Services",
    "content": "Cynbit's flagship service offering is AI Agents and Automation. The team designs and deploys intelligent autonomous agents powered by large language models (LLMs) including GPT-4, Gemini, and open-source models. These agents can handle tasks such as customer support automation, sales qualification, document processing, data extraction, and multi-step workflow orchestration. Cynbit builds both single-agent and multi-agent systems, integrating them into existing business workflows via APIs, webhooks, and no-code connectors. Key deliverables include agent architecture design, prompt engineering, RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) pipelines, and production deployment.",
    "category": "services",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_services_002",
    "source": "cynbit.in/services",
    "title": "LLM Integration & Custom AI Solutions",
    "content": "Cynbit provides end-to-end LLM integration services for businesses looking to embed AI capabilities into their products. This includes fine-tuning foundation models on proprietary data, building RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) systems with vector databases like FAISS, Pinecone, or Weaviate, and creating structured output pipelines using Pydantic and function calling. The team has expertise in prompt optimization, context window management, and evaluation frameworks. Clients receive production-ready AI features with monitoring, logging, and fallback mechanisms built in.",
    "category": "services",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_services_003",
    "source": "cynbit.in/services",
    "title": "Software Development Services",
    "content": "Cynbit offers full-stack software development services with a focus on SaaS products, web applications, and API-first architectures. The team builds with modern stacks including React, Next.js, FastAPI, Django, Node.js, and PostgreSQL. Cynbit specializes in building MVPs for startups, scaling existing products, and migrating legacy systems to cloud-native architectures. Development follows agile methodology with bi-weekly sprints, transparent progress tracking, and continuous deployment pipelines. Average project timeline for an MVP is 6–12 weeks.",
    "category": "services",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_services_004",
    "source": "cynbit.in/services",
    "title": "Growth & Lead Generation Services",
    "content": "Cynbit's Growth & Lead Generation vertical helps businesses acquire and convert customers through data-driven strategies. Services include paid advertising (Google Ads, Meta Ads), SEO and content strategy, CRM integration and automation (HubSpot, Salesforce), conversion funnel design, and lead scoring systems. What differentiates Cynbit's growth services is the integration of AI — using predictive models for lead scoring, AI-generated content for campaigns, and automated follow-up sequences. The team works on performance-based engagements, focusing on measurable ROI.",
    "category": "services",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_services_005",
    "source": "cynbit.in/services",
    "title": "Autonomous Workflow Design",
    "content": "Cynbit designs autonomous multi-step workflows that reduce human intervention in repetitive business processes. Typical workflows include: automated lead intake and qualification, invoice processing and approval chains, employee onboarding automation, customer support ticket routing, and data pipeline orchestration. These workflows are built using tools like n8n, Zapier, Make (Integromat), custom Python scripts, and LLM-powered decision nodes. Each workflow is thoroughly tested and includes fallback paths and human-in-the-loop checkpoints for critical decisions.",
    "category": "services",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_products_001",
    "source": "cynbit.in/products/bitelevate",
    "title": "BitElevate – Adaptive Learning Platform",
    "content": "BitElevate is Cynbit's flagship EdTech product — an adaptive learning platform designed to personalize education across 16+ cognitive and learning style dimensions. The platform uses AI to assess each student's learning pace, comprehension patterns, preferred content formats (video, text, quizzes), and performance trajectories. It then dynamically adjusts the curriculum, content difficulty, and teaching style in real time. BitElevate is designed with digital inclusion as a core principle — it works effectively on low-bandwidth connections and supports regional language interfaces, making quality education accessible to students from underserved communities.",
    "category": "products",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_products_002",
    "source": "cynbit.in/products/bitelevate",
    "title": "BitElevate – Social Impact & Manav Seva Trust Partnership",
    "content": "Cynbit has partnered with the Manav Seva Trust to deploy BitElevate for digital inclusion initiatives. Through this partnership, BitElevate is being made available to students from economically disadvantaged backgrounds who lack access to quality personalized education. The Manav Seva Trust partnership represents Cynbit's commitment to the 'Engineering for Optimism' philosophy — using technology to create social equity. The platform has been deployed in pilot programs across Rajasthan, offering AI-powered tutoring to students who would otherwise not have access to such resources.",
    "category": "products",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_products_003",
    "source": "cynbit.in/products/tenanteasy",
    "title": "TenantEase – Property Management SaaS",
    "content": "TenantEase is a SaaS platform built by Cynbit for property managers, landlords, and real estate companies. It digitizes and automates the entire tenant lifecycle — from property listing and applicant screening, to lease management, rent collection, maintenance request tracking, and tenant communication. TenantEase uses AI for applicant risk scoring, automated rent reminder sequences, and predictive maintenance alerting. The platform is built for the Indian real estate market, supporting UPI payments, Indian lease agreement formats, and GST-compliant invoicing. It targets individual landlords, co-living operators, and mid-size property management firms.",
    "category": "products",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_products_004",
    "source": "cynbit.in/products/cynbit-studio",
    "title": "Cynbit Studio – AI Agent Builder",
    "content": "Cynbit Studio is a no-code/low-code platform that allows businesses to design, test, and deploy AI agents without deep technical expertise. Users can visually compose agent workflows, connect data sources (documents, databases, APIs), configure LLM settings, and publish agents as embeddable chat widgets or API endpoints. Cynbit Studio abstracts away the complexity of prompt engineering, RAG pipeline setup, and LLM API management — enabling non-technical teams to build AI-powered customer assistants, internal knowledge bots, and process automation agents.",
    "category": "products",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_products_005",
    "source": "cynbit.in/products/revio",
    "title": "Revio – Revenue Intelligence Platform",
    "content": "Revio is Cynbit's revenue intelligence product designed for sales teams and growth leaders. It aggregates data from CRMs, marketing platforms, and customer touchpoints to provide a unified view of the revenue funnel. Revio uses AI to identify deal risks, surface high-priority opportunities, forecast pipeline outcomes, and recommend next-best actions for sales representatives. Key features include lead scoring, churn prediction, meeting intelligence (call transcript analysis), and automated CRM data enrichment. Revio is designed as an API-first platform that integrates with HubSpot, Salesforce, Pipedrive, and custom CRMs.",
    "category": "products",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
