    "title": "How to Work with Cynbit",
    "content": "Engaging Cynbit for a project typically follows a structured discovery process. Step 1: Initial consultation call (30 mins) to understand your problem statement and goals. Step 2: Technical scoping session where the Cynbit team proposes an architecture and technology approach. Step 3: Proposal delivery with timeline, team composition, and pricing. Step 4: Kickoff and onboarding. Cynbit works with clients on project-based engagements, dedicated team models, and retainer arrangements. Projects start from ₹2 Lakhs for small MVPs and scale based on complexity. To begin, email opportunities@cynbit.in or call +91 89479 62667.",
