    "content": "Cynbit publishes 'The Architect's Digest', a technical blog covering topics at the intersection of AI, software engineering, and business strategy. The blog targets CTOs, product managers, and technical founders who want depth — not surface-level content. Key editorial categories include: AI Architecture (RAG systems, agent design patterns, LLM evaluation), Engineering Excellence (system design, microservices, DevOps), Growth Engineering (data-driven marketing, funnel optimization), and Impact Stories (how technology creates social change). New posts are published bi-weekly.",
