    "id": "cynbit_faq_001",
    "source": "cynbit.in/faq",
    "title": "Frequently Asked Questions – Cynbit",
    "content": "Q: How long does it take to build an AI agent? A: Simple agents (single-tool, single-purpose) can be built in 1–2 weeks. Complex multi-agent systems with RAG, custom integrations, and evaluation frameworks typically take 4–8 weeks. Q: Do you work with non-technical clients? A: Yes. Cynbit handles the full technical implementation. Clients need to provide domain expertise and business context, not technical knowledge. Q: Can you integrate with our existing software? A: Yes. Cynbit builds integrations with virtually any system that has an API. We have built integrations with HubSpot, Salesforce, Razorpay, Zoho, Notion, Slack, and many others.",
    "category": "company",
    "last_updated": "2026-10-29"
  },
  {
    "id": "cynbit_faq_002",
    "source": "cynbit.in/faq",
    "title": "FAQs – Data Security and Privacy",
    "content": "Q: How do you handle our data security? A: Cynbit follows industry-standard security practices including encrypted data transmission (TLS 1.3), encrypted storage, role-based access control, and regular security audits. For AI systems, Cynbit can deploy models on-premise or in private cloud environments to ensure data never leaves your infrastructure. Q: Do you sign NDAs? A: Yes, standard NDAs are signed before any technical discussions. Q: Are your AI systems compliant with data protection laws? A: Cynbit designs systems compliant with India's DPDP Act 2023 and, where applicable, GDPR.",
